# L §5.18 (round 8): "explain low(x, span) without from explains the day of its lowest balance as a balance"; L
# §5.14.1: without from, low is the lowest of the plain end-of-day balances. konto opens at 100.00 PLN; out 10.00 on
# 01-05, in 10.00 on 01-10, out 10.00 on 01-15: 100 (01-01..04), 90 (01-05..09), 100 (01-10..14), 90 (01-15..).
# one: over 01-01 .. 01-12 the lowest, 90.00 PLN, is held 01-05 .. 01-09 with no entry between: explained at
# 01-05. two: over 01-01 .. 01-31 it is reached on two runs of days with movements between; L §5.18 (as now worded)
# "explains the first day its lowest balance is reached, as a balance": 01-05 again (writer 5's T-87, stated).
=== m.tally
model g
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input d1: date
input d2: date
input d3: date
input amt: money PLN

move out1: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

move in2: transfers
  on d2
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

move out3: transfers
  on d3
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

ask one: explain low(konto, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-12)
ask two: explain low(konto, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  d1 = 2026-01-05
  d2 = 2026-01-10
  d3 = 2026-01-15
  amt = 10.00 PLN
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "bilans"
=== expect
one: 90.00 PLN
  lowest end-of-day balance of konto on 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-12: 90.00 PLN, on 2026-01-05 (through 2026-01-09)
  balance of konto (PLN) at the end of 2026-01-05
  from: opening v:opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN, 2026-01-01 start (version v, source s, locator "bilans")
  2026-01-05:
    out1.cash (past): -10.00 PLN
...
two: 90.00 PLN
  lowest end-of-day balance of konto on 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31: 90.00 PLN, on 2026-01-05 (through 2026-01-09)
  balance of konto (PLN) at the end of 2026-01-05
  from: opening v:opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN, 2026-01-01 start (version v, source s, locator "bilans")
  2026-01-05:
    out1.cash (past): -10.00 PLN
...
